{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnKpwVNBENza9KXhXbu4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The Lantern Keeper**\n\nAt the edge of a sleeping town,\nwhere the cobbled road gives way to sand,\na keeper climbs the lighthouse stairs\nwith a lantern in her hand.\n\nEach night she counts the hundred steps,\nher shadow long and thin,\nand wakes the great glass heart of light\nto let the dark roll in.\n\nThe sea is a restless sleeper,\nturning under its silver sheet,\nwhispering old and salted names\nagainst the harbor's feet.\n\nShe knows them all, the wanderers,\nthe freighters and the sails,\nthe little boats with patched-up hulls\nthat dance through winter gales.\n\nAnd though she never meets their crews,\nnor hears their grateful cries,\nshe sends her beam across the waves\nlike a promise in the skies.\n\n\"Here is the shore,\" the lamplight says.\n\"Here is the rock, the reef.\nSteer wide of every danger, friend,\nand carry home your grief.\"\n\nThe storms come in like hungry wolves,\nwith thunder in their jaws,\nand rattle every window pane\nand test the lighthouse walls.\n\nBut she is steady as the stone,\nher hands upon the flame,\nand when the wind demands her fear,\nshe answers with a name:\n\nthe name of every sailor lost,\nthe name of every star,\nthe name of dawn, still hidden deep\nbehind the harbor bar.\n\nThen morning spills its gold across\nthe waking, weary tide.\nShe dims the lamp, and down she climbs,\nwith nothing left to hide.\n\nThe ships have passed. The night is done.\nThe gulls begin to sing.\nShe sleeps the day in quiet peace,\na keeper without a king.\n\nFor light is only kindness, lit\nand held against the gloom,\na small and stubborn burning thing\nthat makes the darkness room.\n\nAnd somewhere out beyond the swell,\na sailor lifts his eyes,\nand finds, because she kept the watch,\nhis way home through the skies."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5599,"cache_read_input_tokens":11382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5599},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4cb1fdef-921c-4a98-8669-720a9bef7d01","uuid":"f4c8f0f7-7cd4-4d56-b421-d7b504385c4d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T20:43:37.966Z","request_id":"req_011CgnKpwHTMXD4Cud77Bs2V"}
